 "text": "Two astronauts who have been living on the International Space Station since June of last year are about to get their ride back to Earth. SpaceX launched four astronauts from Kennedy Space Center in Florida on Friday night to the space station. Butch Wilmore and Suni Williams have been on the space station since their Boeing Starliner capsule suffered a malfunction and returned to Earth without them. Wilmore and Williams are expected back on Earth next week.",
